      "details": "Move the pathComparator state and the implementation of getPathComparator(boolean), including the selection and construction of DurationComparator and PathComparator, into RouteRequestPathComparator. Retain RouteRequest.getPathComparator(boolean) as a compatibility method that delegates to the extracted responsibility and retain the existing pathComparator field semantics. RouteRequest continues to expose Comparator<GraphPath> and the boolean parameter, but no longer directly references DurationComparator or PathComparator. The target gains one dependency on RouteRequestPathComparator while eliminating two distinct outgoing dependencies, for an expected net Fan-Out reduction of one.",
